# Monorepo-wide ignores
node_modules/
**/.svelte-kit/
**/build/
**/.output/
**/.vercel/
**/.netlify/
**/.wrangler/
**/dist/
!apps/cms/extensions/noindex/dist/
!apps/cms/extensions/noindex/dist/index.js
**/test-results*/
**/.turbo/
/apps/cms/.asset-audit/
# Vitest results cache — relocated from node_modules/.vite so CI can cache it
# (apps/web/vite.config.ts cacheDir under VITEST; slice-28.4 audit #132)
**/.vitest/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.test
*.env.1password

*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
bun.lockb
vite.config.js.timestamp-*
vite.config.ts.timestamp-*
.remember/
.worktrees/
Weather_API_Key.txt

# SVGO source backups kept local only — committed file is the optimized source of truth
apps/web/static/images/*.source.svg

